  "scope": "Matched 300-request continuous closed-loop episodes with 75 resident CPU prefixes, four distinct suffixes per prefix and one GPU reset before measurement. No intermediate reset or prime. The 75-request option reproduces the original episode shape. Both arms use tensor-major CPU storage, allocator avoidance, ascending GPU assignment, H2D/D2H merging, packet alignment and global GPU reuse fences. The candidate submits eligible loads on an independent ready stream after checking authoritative zeroing, copy, preemption, synchronous-load and store-reuse footprints. Frozen predictor, preparation, cache capacity, model, FP8 KV, original selector, 8 MiB/depth-two H2D, 90 ms subtraction and 100 ms setup lead remain fixed. Final trace-drain time includes the draining policy RPC and trace file reads; it is reported outside request throughput."
